{
  "name": "dsh-session-favicon",
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "Paints THIS tab's DSH session state onto the browser tab icon — spinner while running, green dot when done, amber dot while it waits for you, red dot after an error, original icon untouched when idle — with per-scheme badges for light and dark mode. · 在 DSH web 的标签页图标上显示「本标签页会话」的状态：运行中转圈、完成绿点、等待输入橙黄点、出错红点；空闲保持原图标，并适配明暗两套 favicon。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/XiaoXice/dsh-session-favicon.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/XiaoXice/dsh-session-favicon",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/XiaoXice/dsh-session-favicon/issues"
  },
  "icon": "icon.svg",
  "type": "module",
  "engines": {
    "dsh": ">=0.2.0-0"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek",
    "harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "favicon",
    "session",
    "browser-tab"
  ],
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "docs/*.svg",
    "README.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true
    }
  }
}
